## How to decide
- No Issue: Every group with an assertion side found corroborating evidence in at least one of categories A, B, C or E, values reconcile within tolerance, and no internal arithmetic contradiction was found.
- Potential Concern: Any material client fact, financial figure, plan value or holding asserted in the report either contradicts the evidence or has no supporting document; or the report contradicts itself on a figure it relies on. Do not raise a finding on the suitability of recommendations, attitude to risk, capacity for loss, knowledge and experience, investment suitability or product selection rationale — those are CHK-002 to CHK-004 and CHK-006 to CHK-009.
